  "label": "Absurd Juxtaposition Meme Trope",
  "description": "This meme format relies on placing an incongruous or absurd label on a mundane or innocent scene to create humor. The humor derives from the mismatch between the image (children playing in water) and the text (Sea Monkeys), which is a manufactured, artificial concept. Understanding this trope requires knowledge of internet meme culture and the conventions of visual humor.",
